# generated/

Auto-generated Rust code from Protocol Buffer definitions. This directory contains prost-generated Rust bindings for UDEX service APIs, organized into three primary domains: index management, entry/context operations, and health checks. All files are generated by the build script and should not be edited manually.

## Files

- `mod.rs` -- Module root that re-exports all generated protobuf packages (udex.index.v1, udex.entry.v1, udex.healthz.v1) and google.protobuf
- `udex.index.v1.rs` -- Index service types: Index, IndexUpdate, DescribeRequest, DescribeResponse, CreateIndexRequest, and HashAlgorithm enum
- `udex.entry.v1.rs` -- Entry and context types: Value (oneof for string/int/float/bool), KeyValuePair, Context, ContextInput, and CreateEntryRequest/Response
- `udex.healthz.v1.rs` -- Health check service: HealthzRequest, HealthzResponse, and HealthzServiceClient gRPC client
- `google.protobuf.rs` -- Google protobuf Timestamp type for server time representations
